    {
      "id": "color",
      "label": [
        "颜色",
        "Color"
      ],
      "description": [
        "定义颜色承担的界面角色及主题映射。",
        "Define UI color roles and theme mappings."
      ],
      "rule": [
        "相同色值可以承担不同语义；按用途定义。图标色、描边色归入颜色。",
        "Equal values may carry different meanings. Define by purpose; icon and border colors belong here."
      ],
